			"hadithnumber": 2917,
			"arabicnumber": 2917,
			"text": "It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:“I was by the knees of the she-camel of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), at Shajarah. When it rose up with him, he said: ‘Labbaika bi ‘Umrah wa Hajjah ma’an [Here I am (O Allah) for ‘Umrah and Hajj together].’ That was during the Farewell Pilgrimage.”",
